{
  "_doc": "Intent rules and responses of the rule classifier (builtin_ai.md 6.3 to 6.5, 18; PK-M0-26). score = base + keyword x groups hit + pattern x template hit + entity x needed kinds present + feature x matching features + exclude x exclude terms + context bonus; a clause takes the best rule at or over the threshold (ties: higher priority, then earlier rule), else unknown. Terms starting with @ name a group of data/dialogue/lexicon.json; pattern syntax in src/systems/dialogue/intent/pattern.ts. Responses: R1 topic answer, R2 reaction, R3 ledger refusal, R4 redirect, R5 system entry, R6 cognition evidence, R7 relation write, R8 notification, R9 end; `if` names a condition of src/systems/dialogue/intent/respond.ts; slots may use {band}, {part}, {activity} and {state}.",
  "threshold": 5,
  "weights": {
    "keyword": 3,
    "pattern": 4,
    "entity": 3,
    "feature": 1,
    "exclude": -5
  },
